{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumUniverses.RigidMonoidalCategory","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumUniverses.RigidMonoidalCategory","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Basic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.snake_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.snake_right","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/rigid-monoidal-category.lean#L49-L49","doc":"**Snake identity (right)**: the composite\n`V∨ →[λ_⁻¹] 𝟙 ⊗ V∨ →[coev ▷ V∨] (V∨ ⊗ V) ⊗ V∨ →[α] V∨ ⊗ (V ⊗ V∨)\n →[V∨ ◁ ev] V∨ ⊗ 𝟙 →[ρ_] V∨`\nequals `𝟙 V∨`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.snake_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.snake_left","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/rigid-monoidal-category.lean#L42-L42","doc":"**Snake identity (left)**: the composite\n`V →[ρ⁻¹] V ⊗ 𝟙 →[V ◁ coev] V ⊗ (V∨ ⊗ V) →[α⁻¹] (V ⊗ V∨) ⊗ V\n →[ev ▷ V] 𝟙 ⊗ V →[λ_] V`\nequals `𝟙 V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.coeval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.coeval","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/rigid-monoidal-category.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Coevaluation morphism `coev : 𝟙 → V∨ ⊗ V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.eval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.eval","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/rigid-monoidal-category.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Evaluation morphism `ev : V ⊗ V∨ → 𝟙`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.V_dual","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.V_dual","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/rigid-monoidal-category.lean#L33-L33","doc":"The (right) dual object `V∨`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.V","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/rigid-monoidal-category.lean#L31-L31","doc":"The object for which we exhibit rigidity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory.mk","kind":"ctor","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/rigid-monoidal-category.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RigidMonoidalCategory","kind":"structure","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/rigid-monoidal-category.lean#L21-L51","doc":"**Rigid monoidal category data**: for a given object `V` in a monoidal\ncategory `C`, a rigidity structure consists of a dual `V∨`, evaluation\n`ev : V ⊗ V∨ → 𝟙`, and coevaluation `coev : 𝟙 → V∨ ⊗ V` satisfying\nthe snake identities.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:rigid-monoidal-category}`\nRef: [kock2004] https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511615443 ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:rigid-monoidal-category","label":"def:rigid-monoidal-category","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/rigid-monoidal-category.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}